    "20+ built-in plugins for Mail, Calendar, Browser, Files, and more. Import skills from GitHub. Connect MCP servers. All with your permission.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "20+ eingebaute Plugins für Mail, Kalender, Browser, Dateien und mehr. Importiere Skills von GitHub. Verbinde MCP-Server. Alles mit deiner Erlaubnis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "20 多个用于邮件、日历、浏览器、文件等的内置插件。从 GitHub 导入技能。连接 MCP 服务器。一切都经过您的许可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A microphone button will appear in the chat input when voice is ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
