          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理安全地运行 shell 命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents, memory, tools, and identity that live on your Mac.\nModels are interchangeable — everything else compounds, stays with you.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agenten, Gedächtnis, Tools und Identität – direkt auf deinem Mac.\nModelle sind austauschbar – alles andere wächst mit dir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 上的代理、内存、工具和身份。\n模型是可以互换的——其他一切都是复合的，永远伴随着你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents, voice, and themes": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agenten, Stimme und Themes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理、语音和主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aggressive search. Up to 15 tools loaded, may increase prompt size.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aggressive Suche. Bis zu 15 Tools geladen, kann Prompt-Größe erhöhen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "积极的搜索。最多加载 15 个工具，可能会增加提示大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
